    "content": "> [!important] Layer 2 Begins\n> In Layer 1 you learned to see and specify. In Layer 2 you build deterministic systems that reliably separate variables.\n\n\n---\n\n# Part III — BUILD (Weeks 5–6)\n\n[[#Table of Contents|↑ Back to TOC]]\n\n## Part Purpose\n\nTurn the brief into an operational system.\n\nYou learn that a pipeline is not a collection of tricks. It is a model of causality.\n\nThis part also embeds **tool discipline, versioning, and data policy** as part of the working process — not as a later professional concern.\n\n---"
