    "content": "> [!important] The Final Intensive Horizon\n> In Part VI you prove that your creative voice is not dependent on prompts, teachers, or client briefs.\n\n\n---\n\n# Part VI — AUTHOR & TRANSFER (Weeks 11–12)\n\n[[#Table of Contents|↑ Back to TOC]]\n\n## Part Purpose\n\nYou now have tools, methods, criteria, and experience.\n\nThe question becomes:\n\n> [!question] **What do you repeatedly choose when nobody tells you what to choose?**\n\nThis part also introduces:\n\n- **cross-medium synthesis** — fusing visual and writing into one authored object\n- **public process** — deciding which internal artifacts become external work\n\n---"
