    "content": "## Intensive Projects\n\n### Project 1 — Problem-Finding, Observation & Diagnosis Portfolio\n\n**Weeks 1–2**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- 15 diagnoses (8 visual, 7 textual)\n- 6 visual perception studies\n- 3 close readings\n- personal ladders\n- first anchor set\n- problem-finding log (4+ entries with positionality, 1 problem carried forward)\n- non-instrumental attention log (2+ entries)\n- play log (2+ entries)\n- transfer test\n- practice log\n\n### Project 2 — Premise & Brief Lab\n\n**Weeks 3–4**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- 6 premise records\n- 6 briefs\n- 12–18 thumbnail / outline studies\n- 6 rejected premises\n- problem-finding log (4+ new entries)\n- non-instrumental attention log (2+ new entries)\n- play log (2+ new entries)\n- 6 provenance records\n- transfer test\n- practice log\n\n### Project 3 — Build a Working System\n\n**Weeks 5–6**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- 1 visual pipeline system\n- 1 writing pipeline system\n- variable maps\n- failure maps\n- 12 controlled visual variations\n- 8 controlled writing variations\n- human-only craft studies\n- problem-finding log (4+ new entries)\n- calibration log (5+ entries with confidence)\n- versioning and data policy documented\n- play log (2+ new entries)\n- transfer test\n- practice log\n\n### Project 4 — Calibrate Taste\n\n**Weeks 7–8**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- 2 anchor libraries (15+ anchors each)\n- 20 comparative judgments\n- 2 slop criteria\n- 3 demotions\n- blind-ranking test\n- reverse-direction test\n- prediction test\n- problem-finding log (4+ new entries)\n- calibration log (5+ new entries)\n- taste-range audit\n- play log (2+ new entries)\n- transfer test\n- practice log\n\n### Project 5 — Directed Production\n\n**Weeks 9–10**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- 1 visual project\n- 1 writing project\n- stakeholder critique\n- stakeholder communication log\n- scope and revision-discipline statement\n- revision / re-brief record\n- refusals\n- defenses\n- problem-finding log (4+ new entries)\n- calibration log continued\n- play log (2+ new entries)\n- transfer test\n- practice log\n\nContextual:\n- collaboration drill (if applicable)\n- economics agreement (if applicable)\n\n### Project 6 — Authorship, Synthesis & Blank Sheet\n\n**Weeks 11–12**\n\nDeliverable:\n\n- authorial position\n- visual portfolio (5–8 case studies)\n- writing portfolio (5–8 case studies)\n- artist / author statement\n- revenue / professional pathway\n- outreach artifact\n- blank-sheet capstone (with problem-finding record + positionality check)\n- transfer reflection\n- practice log\n- complete problem-finding log\n- complete non-instrumental attention log\n- complete calibration log\n- complete play log\n- one synthesis work (visual + writing)\n- one public process piece\n\n---"
